        {
          "text": "Emva kwakhe kwalungisa uMeremoti, indodana ka-Uriya, indodana kaKoshi, elinye ibanga, kusukela ekungeneni kwendlu ka-Eliyashibi kuze kube sekugcineni kwendlu ka-Eliyashibi.",
