        {
          "text": "Ngemva kwakhe, uHananiya, indodana kaShelemiya, noHanuni, indodana yesithupha kaSalafi, balungisa elinye ibanga. Emva kwakhe kwalungisa uMeshulamu indodana kaBeregiya ekamelweni lakhe.",
